{"ts": "2026-11-19T14:08:42.428240Z", "run_id": "r-20261119T1403Z-ccf1", "unit": "openspec:add-app-shell", "seq": 13, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-007", "id": "Q-007", "status": "answered", "reason": "The spec scenario names nav-group-map.test.ts as the test and lists constants as the subject; the Node test asserts every row and the constants in nav-groups.ts match the specified map and labels. Nothing about a browser page can observe these constants, so the hold on a missing e2e test adds no evidence.", "called": true, "tasks": [], "target": "H-817f132e", "kind": "verdict", "batch": "Q-006+5", "batch_size": 5, "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.569197, "decision": "accept", "answer_sha256": "3db396073e01d69bc1970e23405b75f96d2b3b584303025be9a77e624847cdf7", "checked": [{"ref": "spec:specs/web-shell/spec.md#scenario-the-map-covers-every-navigation-id-and-nothing-else", "quote": "and the ids with a `navLabel` in `ADMIN_PAGES`", "claim": "The specification assigns this criterion to a Node test that reads module constants and page tables."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-group-map.test.ts:35", "quote": "assert.deepEqual(Object.keys(NAV_GROUP_OF).sort(), Object.keys(EXPECTED).sort());", "claim": "The Node test asserts the exact key set of the map."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-group-map.test.ts:45", "quote": "assert.deepEqual(NAV_GROUP_LABELS, { home: null, build: \"Build\", admin: \"Admin\", more: \"More\" });", "claim": "The Node test asserts the fixed labels."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.ts:14", "quote": "export const NAV_GROUP_OF: Readonly<Record<string, NavGroupId>> = {", "claim": "The map holds the ten specified ids and nothing else."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.ts:27", "quote": "export const NAV_GROUP_LABELS: Readonly<Record<NavGroupId, string | null>> = {", "claim": "The labels are the specified four values."}]}
