{"ts": "2026-11-19T14:08:42.531813Z", "run_id": "r-20261119T1403Z-ccf1", "unit": "openspec:add-app-shell", "seq": 15, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-008", "id": "Q-008", "status": "answered", "reason": "Read the spec scenario, the Node test for G1 to G9 and the implementation; the inputs are in-process values and the assertions include reference identity and a frozen array, which no page interaction can reproduce. The hold therefore cannot be met and the criterion is already traced by a passing Node test.", "called": true, "tasks": [], "target": "H-49d28f26", "kind": "verdict", "batch": "Q-006+5", "batch_size": 5, "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.569197, "decision": "accept", "answer_sha256": "b99f9fee486690449bb8ef6f5c92fb85c5837f7d0cb2c95c1d807673bc160f09", "checked": [{"ref": "spec:specs/web-shell/spec.md#scenario-entries-are-grouped-ordered-and-passed-through", "quote": "G7 returns the same item objects (`===`), ten in all", "claim": "The criterion asserts object identity, which only an in-process test can check."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.test.ts:61", "quote": "G7 frozen input passes through unchanged", "claim": "The Node test covers the frozen-input row."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.test.ts:69", "quote": "assert.equal(out[1]?.items[0], input[8]);", "claim": "The Node test asserts reference identity of the passed-through items."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.test.ts:57", "quote": "const ids = [\"constructor\", \"toString\", \"__proto__\", \"hasOwnProperty\"];", "claim": "The Node test covers the prototype-style ids."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.ts:39", "quote": "const id = Object.hasOwn(NAV_GROUP_OF, item.id) ? NAV_GROUP_OF[item.id] : undefined;", "claim": "Unknown and prototype-style ids go to More without mutating the input."}]}
